                <pb facs="0787" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg685"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3742/7.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President-elect Leguia to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima, Peru</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-05-29"><hi rendition="#italic">May 29,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I deeply appreciate Mrs. Root’s and your congratulations upon my presidential
                    election and tender you my sincerest thanks therefor.</p>
                <p>I regard your kind message as a further proof of friendship toward Peru, which my
                    administration will at all times reciprocate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leguia.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
